    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13033" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολείβω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let drip</i>: hence, <i>pour a libation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολλείψας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					793
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρον ἀπολεῖβον μέλι</span>
			<i>dropping</i> honey, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.75
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυα τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.21
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴχνη ὥραν ἀπολείβει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>drop</i> or <i>run down from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.107
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔραζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					174
				</span></i>
			.</div>
